  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-designing transformative adaptation strategies with communities in Samoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IF a truly transformative vision and corresponding solutions have been co-designed with the most vulnerable communities THEN Samoa will have the ability to access or scale up climate finance, ultimately enabling communities to cope with climate change BECAUSE Samoa?s enabling environment will have been enhanced due to improved strategic frameworks and increased climate financing.</narrative>
